The model is not included. quality.js reads DNSMOS P.835's network, DNSMOS/DNSMOS/sig_bak_ovr.onnx
(1,157,965 bytes, SHA-256 269fbebdb513aa23cddfbb593542ecc540284a91849ac50516870e1ac78f6edd), from
opts.weights, the neural cache, or the same repository at the same commit:
